},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"IZ6vx85mSdC2zp0STFzTIw","review_id":"3S0EKZv-0T4tK-j2m5mT4g","date":"2020-03-15T05:40:35","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.944471538066864,"text_excerpt":"We came in on a Saturday night (3/14). The restaurant wasn't empty nor was it packed. We were quickly seated and given menus. It's a cute little place with good vibes. We ordered the Maboroshi sake, smashed cucumbers, five scented edamame, vegan lover dumplings, spicy dan dan noodles, golden nugget, curried favor dumplings, and mama's dumplings. Below are the items that I did eat. -Maboroshi sake (V) Please note that I didn't verify if this particular one is vegan since sakes generally are. I found this to be light in flavor and extremely easy to go down. -Edamame (V) We found this to be your average edamame. But it could be that the rest of my meal was heavily flavored and so I couldn't ..."},{"business_id":"IZ6vx85mSdC2zp0STFzTIw","review_id":"-x1miaYDbaD1xOjWxwZXtQ","date":"2020-03-06T16:17:47","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9401625394821167,"text_excerpt":"Thanks for a great dinner Luvi! TLDR: We were impressed by their high quality, fresh ingredients and gorgeous presentation. Cheers chefs! Full story: The restaurant is small, so if you're more than two, I definitely recommend making reservation. They were gracious despite my party of 4 running 15 min late. Oops. The interior is strikingly stylish. Love the floral chairs and dramatic wallpaper. To start they have several creative cocktails and an impressive sake list. We started with two off menu specials: the crawfish wonton was amazing! I thought the vegan dumplings had delicious flavor, but kinda hard to eat bc as one dinner complained, they are very \"slippy\". We then tried 5 raw plates..."},{"business_id":"IZ6vx85mSdC2zp0STFzTIw","review_id":"u8peAwHIcnSfGY7Yu8baLA","date":"2019-04-08T22:28:06","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9398035407066345,"text_excerpt":"I got invited to try their new menu tasting and I am not gonna lie, THANK YOU for establishing LUVI! This place is not close to CBD, French Quarter or Metairie so you definitely have to plan accordingly, meaning if you are going to drive up here, make sure to control your alcohol intake because they had so many yummy cocktails! It actually has been a while so I cannot remember the name of dishes I got to try but everything was amaze-ball. Favorite dish for your Asian girl was mamas dumpling if I am not mistaken. I really need to come back here for their raw bar as it looked awesome. The chef Hao was very friendly and our bartender was very talkative too! Keep in mind that this restaurant ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"IZ6vx85mSdC2zp0STFzTIw","photo_id":"ujJ1YDAKtcqYKX8whUFHiA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ujJ1YDAKtcqYKX8whUFHiA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8639228343963623},{"business_id":"IZ6vx85mSdC2zp0STFzTIw","photo_id":"NPx9WxHHU8BlsTTMU94g-g","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/NPx9WxHHU8BlsTTMU94g-g.jpg","visual_representativeness